add table ip ferm
delete table ip ferm
add table ip ferm
add chain ip ferm INPUT { type filter hook input priority 0; }
add rule ip ferm INPUT meta random & 2147483647 < 1073741824 accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT meta random & 2147483647 < 2147483648 drop
add rule ip ferm INPUT numgen inc mod 10 3 accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT numgen inc mod 4 0 drop
